# CODEOWNERS
#
# Owner:           Governance and Compliance Manager
# Purpose:         Enforces mandatory subject-matter review on every pull request. Combined with
#                  the "Require review from Code Owners" branch protection rule on main, this file
#                  is the mechanical control that makes peer review non-optional.
# Audit relevance: Primary evidence for Control 3.1 - changes are peer reviewed and approved by a
#                  competent reviewer before deployment.
# Review cadence:  Quarterly, and whenever team membership changes.
#
# Rules are evaluated last-match-wins. Keep the most specific paths at the bottom.

# -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Default owner for anything not matched below
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*                                   @example-partner/cloud-platform

# -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Infrastructure as Code
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
/bicep/                             @example-partner/platform-engineering @example-partner/architects
/bicep/networking.bicep             @example-partner/platform-engineering @example-partner/architects @example-partner/cloud-security
/bicep/identity.bicep               @example-partner/cloud-security @example-partner/architects
/bicep/governance.bicep             @example-partner/cloud-security @example-partner/governance
/bicep/sql-managed-instance.bicep   @example-partner/data-migration @example-partner/architects
/bicep/monitoring.bicep             @example-partner/platform-engineering
/bicepconfig.json                   @example-partner/platform-engineering

# -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Customer configuration
# Production parameter files additionally require Delivery Manager sign-off, because they carry the
# customer change board reference and the agreed maintenance window.
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
